<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Forum | Research AI Commons"><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><div class="eyebrow">Research AI Forum</div><h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.7rem)">Take questions from the Café<br/>and explore them with specialists.</h1><p class="lead">The Forum is a more structured event built around a specific question, with invited researchers, specialists, university staff, or external speakers.</p><h2>Possible themes</h2><ul><li>Experimental science × information science</li><li>AI-generated code and reproducibility</li><li>Research data, intellectual property, and security</li><li>AI agents and automated research workflows</li><li>Skills researchers need in an AI-rich environment</li></ul><p>The first Forum topic will be selected from questions that emerge in actual Café discussions.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
